WEBVTT

NOTE Visual descriptions only. Audio speech has not been verified.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
A farmer stands in a wide, dry field. Cracked earth fills the foreground as the camera moves closer.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.625
An illuminated cultivation tower stands beyond a wet field beneath dark clouds. Its lights reflect in the water.

00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:08.333
Close view beneath a growing tray: exposed roots hang around a nozzle releasing a fine mist.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.010
The camera rises above the tray to show green rice leaves and grain heads.
